mple question: what would browser gaming feel like if the platform around it received the same design attention as the games themselves?"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-12 space-y-10","children":[["$","section","A platform, not a launcher",{"className":"glass rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl","children":"A platform, not a launcher"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg","children":[["$","p","Gaming Horizon is not intended to download or stream desktop games. Its foundation is instant-play HTML5 and browser-native experiences. The platform layer helps players discover, organize, revisit, and discuss those games.",{"children":"Gaming Horizon is not intended to download or stream desktop games. Its foundation is instant-play HTML5 and browser-native experiences. The platform layer helps players discover, organize, revisit, and discuss those games."}],["$","p","That distinction shapes every product decision. The homepage should lead with playable experiences. Profiles should reflect meaningful activity. Community and AI features should help people find and understand games rather than distract from them.",{"children":"That distinction shapes every product decision. The homepage should lead with playable experiences. Profiles should reflect meaningful activity. Community and AI features should help people find and understand games rather than distract from them."}]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Designing a connected ecosystem",{"className":"glass rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl","children":"Designing a connected ecosystem"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg","children":["$L4"]}],"$L5"]}],"$L6"]}]]}]}],["$L7"],"$L8"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"JTEY